namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTweener {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener
    src   "Class for manage single tween"
    text  "用于管理单个补间的类"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:curveFloat {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:curveFloat
    src   "The curve SetCurveFloat bound the tween function to, held for as long as this tween lives, so the\ncurve stays loaded for as long as something can still evaluate it. The tween function itself reads\nthe curve through a weak pointer it checks on every evaluation: a curve that is marked garbage --\ndeleted or replaced in the editor -- is let go of by the collector whatever this holds, and the raw\npointer the function used to keep was then read after the curve was freed."
    text  "SetCurveFloat 绑定到补间函数的曲线，在此补间存活期间一直持有，\n因此只要还有东西能对它求值，该曲线就会保持加载。\n补间函数本身通过一个弱指针读取曲线，并在每次求值时检查该指针：被标记为垃圾的曲线——\n在编辑器中被删除或替换——无论这里持有什么都会被回收器释放，\n而函数原先保留的原始指针随后会在曲线被释放之后被读取。"
    state machine
}

