DreamTweener:Goto {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:Goto
    src   "Send the tween to the given position in time. 0 applies the start value; reaching the end\ncompletes the tween once (with auto-kill off it is then held at its end).\nHas no effect on a tween that is killed or retired.\n@param timePoint Time position to reach (if higher than the whole tween duration the tween will simply reach its end)."
    text  "将补间发送到指定的时间位置。0 表示应用起始值；到达终点时\n补间会完成一次（若关闭自动杀死，则会停留在终点）。\n对已被杀死或已被回收的补间无效。\n@param timePoint 要到达的时间位置（若大于整个补间时长，补间将直接到达终点）。"
