    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:Restart
    src   "Restart animation. Called from the tween's own OnComplete it keeps the tween running.\nHas no effect if the Tween is not started, or once the manager has retired it (finished with\nauto-kill on, or killed): keep it with SetAutoKill(false) to restart it after it finishes."
    text  "重新启动动画。从补间自身的 OnComplete 调用时，会保持补间继续运行。\n如果补间尚未启动，或管理器已将其回收（在开启\n自动终止的情况下完成，或被终止），则无效果：用 SetAutoKill(false) 保留它，以便在完成后重新启动。"
    state machine
}

