DreamTweener:runtimeExternalCurve {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:runtimeExternalCurve
    src   "The ExternalCurve of the FRuntimeFloatCurve SetRuntimeFloatCurve was given, held for the same\nreason, and read by the tween function through a weak pointer for the same reason. Null for a\nruntime curve that carries its keys inline, which the function owns a copy of outright."
    text  "SetRuntimeFloatCurve 所给 FRuntimeFloatCurve 的 ExternalCurve，出于同样的\n原因被持有，并由补间函数出于同样的原因通过弱指针读取。对于内联携带键的\n运行时曲线为 null，此时函数直接持有一份副本。"
