DreamTweener:SetAutoKill {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetAutoKill
    src   "Keep this tween after it finishes, paused at its end, instead of retiring it.\n\nA kept tween stays in the manager's list and answers IsTweening, and Restart or Goto brings it\nback -- which is the point: a hover animation that plays a hundred times need not be a hundred\nobjects. Kill still ends it at once, whatever this says.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started."
    text  "在完成后保留此补间，使其停在结束处，而不是将其回收。\n\n保留的补间会留在管理器的列表中并响应IsTweening，\nRestart或Goto可将其恢复——这正是要点：\n播放上百次的悬停动画无需成为上百个对象。无论此项如何设置，Kill仍会立即结束它。\n如果补间已启动，则无效果。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetAutoPlay {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetAutoPlay
    src   "Whether this tween runs as soon as it is created. Off is a paused tween waiting for Play() --\nDOTween builds them that way, and it is what assembling a tween over several frames needs."
    text  "此补间在创建后是否立即运行。关闭时为已暂停的补间，等待 Play()——\nDOTween 就是这样构建的，这也是跨多帧组装补间所需要的。"
    state machine
}

