DreamTweener:SetFrom {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetFrom
    src   "Run backwards from the target to wherever the value is now, instead of towards the target.\n\nThe \"fade in from transparent\" idiom: authored as a tween TO the value it should end at, then\nturned around, so the end state stays written in one place. The swap happens when the tween\nstarts, because the value it starts from is not known before then.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started."
    text  "从目标值反向运行到当前值所在处，而不是朝目标值运行。\n\n“从透明淡入”惯用法：先按“补间到应当结束的值”编写，再反转方向，\n这样结束状态始终只写在一处。\n反转在补间开始时进行，因为在此之前并不知道起始值。\n如果补间已经开始，则此设置无效。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetLoop {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetLoop
    src   "Set loop of tween.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started.\n@param newLoopType   loop type\n@param newLoopCount  number of cycles to play (-1 for infinite)"
    text  "设置补间的循环。\n如果补间已经开始，则此设置无效。\n@param newLoopType   循环类型\n@param newLoopCount  播放的循环次数（-1表示无限）"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetRuntimeFloatCurve {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetRuntimeFloatCurve
    src   "Set RuntimeFloatCurve as animation curve.\nA curve with no keys evaluates to zero everywhere and would hold the tween at its start, so with the\nCurveFloat ease it falls back to linear, with a warning.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started."
    text  "将RuntimeFloatCurve设置为动画曲线。\n没有关键点的曲线在所有位置都求值为零，会让补间停在起始处，因此使用\nCurveFloat缓动时会回退为线性，并给出警告。\n如果补间已经开始，则此设置无效。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetSpeedBased {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetSpeedBased
    src   "Read `duration` as a SPEED, in value units per second, and work the real duration out from how\nfar the value has to travel. DOTween's SetSpeedBased: what \"slide in at 600 units a second\"\nneeds, so that a panel twice as far away takes twice as long instead of moving twice as fast.\nTween types with no measurable distance (Virtual, Update, DelayFrame, Sequence) keep their\nduration and say so once.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started."
    text  "将`duration`视为速度，单位为每秒的值单位，并根据值需要移动的距离算出实际时长。\n即DOTween的SetSpeedBased：满足“以每秒600单位滑入”这类需求，\n使距离两倍的面板耗时两倍，而不是移动速度快一倍。\n没有可测量距离的补间类型（Virtual、Update、DelayFrame、Sequence）保留其时长，\n并提示一次。\n如果补间已经开始，则此设置无效。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetTickType {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetTickType
    src   "Set TickType of this tween.\nHas no effect if the Tween has already started."
    text  "设置此补间的TickType。\n如果补间已经开始，则此设置无效。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweener:SetTimeScale {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweener.h#DreamTweener:SetTimeScale
    src   "This tween's own speed multiplier, on top of everything else: 2 runs it twice as fast, 0.5 half\nas fast, 0 holds it still. Changeable at any time, like the two switches above and unlike the\nsetters that describe the tween's shape -- changing how fast something is running is the point.\nA negative scale is taken as 0 and one that is not a number is refused, each with a warning."
    text  "此补间自身的速度倍率，叠加在其他一切之上：2表示速度加倍，0.5表示速度减半，0表示保持不动。\n可随时更改，与上面两个开关一样，而不像那些描述补间形态的设置器——改变运行速度正是其目的。\n负的倍率会按0处理，非数字的倍率会被拒绝，\n两者都会给出警告。"
    state machine
}

